DESIGN NOTES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Units convert ONLY at the render boundary via @Environment(\.tsUnits) + Units.convertTemperature
  (KMP core, ADR-005). Efficiency Wh/km→Wh/mi uses the inline KM_PER_MILE factor (web parity:
  no SI efficiency helper exists in the shared core).
- The five SI temperature buckets map EXACTLY to design tokens (no hardcoded hex):
  #3b82f6 chartSeriesSpeed · #06b6d4 chartSeriesRegen · #10b981 chartSeriesBattery
  · #f59e0b chartSeriesEnergy · #ef4444 chartSeriesTemperature.
- Charts are native Swift Charts (Charts framework) — never a WKWebView.
- a11y: panel/chart accessibilityLabels, VoiceOver-friendly metric cards, Dynamic Type
  (Font.TS tokens + minimumScaleFactor), light/dark via tokens, >=44pt picker targets.
- Staleness chip surfaces when the last load is > 2 min old (ADR-013).
- Empty/error arms exercised by EmptyTemperatureImpactDataSource / FailingTemperatureImpactDataSource
  (previews) so no data state is dead logic.

